      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里面我最推荐的是沙布列饼干！\n口感湿润，很好吃喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ec19f999caf722db579dee596bd600a9ffc29511ce328b5deac877c0513e0c4",
