    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8baa4061f135ee2326ee09cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "雪之美人是来自盛冈的赛马娘。\n虽然特雷森学园里也有许多学生来自地方，\n但是地方色彩这么强烈的学生却很少见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0be9e7aa8cb33fb45565e8f0e9635028bac4368a487f436695bd1c180e7bcf12",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
